## Proposed Changes


### Phase 1A — Mock Data (PRD shapes)

We will add mock JSON files that match the PRD shapes *exactly*.

CoinGecko `/coins/{id}/market_chart` shape:
`{ "prices": [[timestamp, price], ...], "market_caps": [...], "total_volumes": [...] }`

Finnhub `/quote` shape:
`{ "c": 182.63, "d": 1.25, "dp": 0.69, "h": 183.10, "l": 181.20, "o": 181.50, "pc": 181.38, "t": 1700000000 }`

Recommended file layout (keeps each file matching the API response object shape):
- `src/mocks/coingecko.market_chart.bitcoin.7d.json`
- `src/mocks/coingecko.market_chart.bitcoin.30d.json`
- `src/mocks/finnhub.quote.AAPL.json`
- `src/mocks/finnhub.quote.TSLA.json`

### Mocks

We will create static mock files in `/src/mocks/` (see Phase 1A) and ensure the returned objects from query functions match the PRD shapes exactly.

